WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:13,910
When did bugs dare to come out and affect order?

2
00:00:13,910 --> 00:00:15,910
It's time to hit it

3
00:00:15,910 --> 00:00:35,830
No one is unwilling to accept it, no one doesn’t believe it

4
00:00:35,830 --> 00:00:37,830
I will never bow my head at this time
